Third-party code
----------------

This work builds on PancakeSwap Infinity, Copyright (C) PancakeSwap, licensed
GPL-2.0-or-later. Nothing under Infinity's `src/` is modified here or in Choice's forks
of it; the forks add deploy configuration only, and each records its own diff against
upstream in `INJECTIVE_FORK.md`.

The complete corresponding source for every contract Choice deploys is:

  choice-exchange/choice_v2_contracts          this repository
  choice-exchange/infinity-core                fork of pancakeswap/infinity-core
  choice-exchange/infinity-periphery           fork of pancakeswap/infinity-periphery
  choice-exchange/infinity-universal-router    fork of pancakeswap/infinity-universal-router

The three forks are pinned by commit in `.gitmodules` / `lib/`, and the same commits are
recorded in `meta.forkPins` in the address book under `deployments/`, so the exact source
behind any deployed address is recoverable from this repository alone.

Two files carry a different identifier and it is deliberate:

  src/interfaces/IGraduationSettler.sol   MIT, mirrored from shroom_launchpad
  src/interfaces/ILaunchpadCore.sol       MIT, mirrored from shroom_launchpad

MIT is GPL-compatible, so the combined work remains distributable under the GPL.
